# Cloudflare honours this file when serving the static assets (Pages & Workers
# static assets). Security headers for the whole site, plus long-cache for the
# content-hashed build assets.
#
# CSP notes:
# - script-src has NO 'unsafe-inline'. The two inline scripts the site ships
#   (pre-paint theme snippet, inlined theme-toggle module) are allowed by
#   sha256 hash. `scripts/csp-hashes.mjs` runs at the end of `npm run build`,
#   hashes the inline bodies found in dist/*.html and replaces the hashes
#   token in the script-src below, in dist/_headers only. Any other inline
#   script is blocked by the browser. Do not hand-edit the hashes.
# - style-src keeps 'unsafe-inline' because the reveal stagger uses inline
#   style attributes (--d delays) and Astro inlines small stylesheets. There
#   is no user-reflected content anywhere, so CSS injection has no vector.
# - The only third-party origin is Cloudflare Web Analytics: its beacon script
#   is injected by Cloudflare at the edge (static.cloudflareinsights.com) and
#   posts to cloudflareinsights.com, so both are allow-listed explicitly.
# - If Cloudflare "Rocket Loader" is ever switched on for the zone it will
#   rewrite scripts and break this CSP. Leave it off.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Permissions-Policy: accelerometer=(), autoplay=(), camera=(), display-capture=(), geolocation=(), gyroscope=(), magnetometer=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; base-uri 'self'; script-src 'self' __CSP_SCRIPT_HASHES__ https://static.cloudflareinsights.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data:; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' https://cloudflareinsights.com; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; form-action 'self'; upgrade-insecure-requests

/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
